{
  "info": {
    "name": "Gocommerce API",
    "description": "Koleksi Postman untuk REST API Gocommerce (Go, Gin, GORM, JWT).\n\nCara pakai:\n1. Jalankan server (`go run main.go`), default di http://localhost:5000.\n2. Jalankan **Auth / Login**. Token otomatis tersimpan di variabel `token`.\n3. Jalankan request lain. Hanya **List Products** yang butuh token.\n\nUbah variabel `baseUrl` pada tab Variables jika server berjalan di alamat lain.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status 200\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "var j = pm.response.json(); if (j.token) { pm.collectionVariables.set(\"token\", j.token); }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/register",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "register"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Mendaftarkan user baru. Token yang dikembalikan otomatis disimpan ke variabel `{{token}}`.\n\nCatatan: password disimpan apa adanya dan field `email` tidak ikut disimpan.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"budi\",\n  \"email\": \"budi@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"rahasia123\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
